<title>PORTUGAL: BES boosts 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>BES boosts 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to Dec 31:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Net 21.47 vs 18.51</p>
<p>Cons net 23.59 vs 19.45</p>
<p>Dividend 131.6 esc vs 114.5 esc</p>
<p>Financial margin 2.7 pct vs 2.9 pct</p>
<p>Total deposits 2,924 vs 2,449</p>
<p>Total loans 1,512 vs 1,222</p>
<p>Net assets 3,474 vs 2,926</p>
<p>ROE   18.7 pct vs 16.5 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Banco Espirito Santo (BES). -- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
